{"date":"2026-10-04","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Nothing in particular happens. The morning goes on.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8","2026-10-03":"988ad816613474bcea5dddd7b897674b951aaa4bd9a7b163222f1d6b4d8eff67"},"reference":"11d7ee3611c0e249683f33585d34740b196401a075e86e86f4e9f204b5bd29d5","time":"09:30","typed_records":[{"amount":1500,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"Ramesh","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:b290d82c8b989205:1","item":"Groceries for Ramesh's kitchen","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"b290d82c8b989205adf8f38d7d846c4e2ec00e159c0cdba8c4d399a179ce0465"},"time":"06:04"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9f1f16843f0ec67a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":3,"sha256":"9f1f16843f0ec67abeaf35e99492cdc47b32ab2fc074c7993a0133031317f091"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, before breakfast: does the estate office work on Sundays, and when does the dhobi come this week? I must settle the file on Monday and the bill on Saturday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:f94c0685789d030d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"f94c0685789d030d0d373abc1edf1515d29141bd90bb1e1ede20749b8de14715"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Office band hai aaj, sir, Monday ko aap aayenge toh kholenge. Dhobi kal subah aayega, ek din pehle aa raha hai is hafte."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b3556a7d4541a9d3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":6,"sha256":"b3556a7d4541a9d31fae1ea8c208ae7a1e19c126e21c06a75110633cdb1ff80d"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Very good, Ramesh. Then breakfast at seven, and after it I shall walk in the garden while the air is clear. Keep the dhobi’s bill ready for tomorrow, and let me see it before he leaves."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d2f2ed5b90c3d588:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"d2f2ed5b90c3d588d4e9bd511301622cc6f16c1ed00b7938cf8089386ebed5c2"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, chhaay ke baad main garden ki side khol dunga. Dhobi ka bill main abhi apke study table par rakhta hoon, aap subah check kar lein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:14a2b0267a81fe6a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":9,"sha256":"14a2b0267a81fe6a15928d1cfc0e2a2a22468e22c70d3c10377db843ed0be6b8"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. I shall look at the bill after breakfast; the garden side may wait until the shade is gone."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d360cb9b57b6d09c:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"d360cb9b57b6d09ce1c12e05c648688becca56f67422f4c20d72ecb0b500a424"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir. Aloo paratha garam hai, curd aur achaar bhi table par hai. Aap aaram se khaayein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9ef3dd854d9bb546:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":12,"sha256":"9ef3dd854d9bb54622b75676880548fdbff4b7957098f01494b5f4bebc3dcdf7"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. Leave it as it is; I shall take it slowly, and you may sit if you are not wanted elsewhere."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:1d0ee86fdee419a0:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":13,"sha256":"1d0ee86fdee419a02a8a1ddbd20ddd5b69662dd1e023a3aeda07c49decf11580"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, main bas ek minute. Ghar wale ka phone aaya tha, unhe bol ke aata hoon. Aap aaram se khaayein, main turant wapas aa jaunga."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:4bf7c1481e406476:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":15,"sha256":"4bf7c1481e40647633063146f4da65a63d20eac97ebb5b0df382879387251eee"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Bilkul, Ramesh. No hurry."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:748f020a7777a60e:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":16,"sha256":"748f020a7777a60ef7ae5635296dad04fcd803db91a0ed370fbffbf5c812e88c"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, aap aaram se khaayein. Main bas bahar aata hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:3d8b4a8b1975381a:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":19,"sha256":"3d8b4a8b1975381aaa6fe9a154928ee00011fb34f30af9e0fb6d8858159f4ab0"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:25","verified":false,"words":"One chai, Sunil. I came for the air, but a man may carry a little heat while he argues with a register."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:bb74395e2a09e2b4:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":20,"sha256":"bb74395e2a09e2b45a53b32ce1dd3077199795e4f50833612867f49785bf68ce"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:25","verified":false,"words":"Twenty rupees, sir. The air is free, but the heat costs extra these days. Don't argue too hard, or the steam will get into your head before the tea does."},{"amount":20,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":null,"direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:bd8410462ad039f7:1","item":"Chai from the stall at the Lodhi Road gate","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"lodhi","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":21,"sha256":"bd8410462ad039f7fe5aed683c08bed9261139dad796afc179ef92705af7164a"},"time":"08:25"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b77edf4528ba121a:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":23,"sha256":"b77edf4528ba121acb1035b250b48e6f207a9e887a341d587711b28b2bcf68a2"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:35","verified":false,"words":"Twenty rupees for a little heat is fair, Sunil, though the air must remain free. The file can wait for the walk; the steam may argue, but I will not let it settle in the head before the tea does."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:4d8b163d70a6a671:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":24,"sha256":"4d8b163d70a6a671642643cb40632a05edcd7293000c687fafba2cb11d62a1d0"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:35","verified":false,"words":"The file can wait, sir, but the steam won't. Here, drink it before it cools or you'll be arguing with the cold next."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:33b3f22b881cdf92:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Sunil","source":{"collection":"entries","index":26,"sha256":"33b3f22b881cdf928d68f04991bcf56a0af09b54808ea9c495b5e33e974791c2"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"08:45","verified":false,"words":"Thank you, Sunil. The file can wait, but I will not argue with a cold glass."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b95d306bf59d73b1:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":27,"sha256":"b95d306bf59d73b1ff1f8bef03aef6870317a2055810bc0dd5c51a5790945185"},"speaker":"Sunil","time":"08:45","verified":false,"words":"That's the spirit, sir. Just don't let it cool down on your tongue, or you'll be back here for another round."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:543bf3be0ce754fe:1","kind":"statement","place":"lodhi","recipient":null,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":29,"sha256":"543bf3be0ce754feca23ff53bc1126aad3a0dc1ae731f33f3b0d3c408aebda3b"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"09:00","verified":false,"words":"You are right, Sunil — the spirit must not cool. But my file is cooler than my blood, and I must let it walk itself out."},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:ed74cbb2c83dc605:1","intended_time":"07:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":0,"sha256":"ed74cbb2c83dc605435db69ca331fc213ccab9a4667638dc315dca436c2aa5f1"},"status":"planned","text":"Have breakfast, and ask Ramesh what the estate office does on Sundays and when the dhobi comes.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:10ff9f38c2a45ff5:1","intended_time":"08:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":1,"sha256":"10ff9f38c2a45ff54898a6fa27d5dc6d89c47678dbf7ee1cdb2cbf50c5bc85a9"},"status":"planned","text":"Walk in Lodhi Gardens while the air is clear, and let the file's contradiction settle.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:7abcaedbd0763990:1","intended_time":"10:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":2,"sha256":"7abcaedbd07639906cfcbafdbfdbbf459afe848af057ead3db4d9410d4b45d27"},"status":"planned","text":"Read the file at home on the misdescription, noting where sign and Notion part.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:71f6325882baf32b:1","intended_time":"13:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":3,"sha256":"71f6325882baf32bf5da335859dd3ea38828f0b74cb06cd1e26bce3fb0542e86"},"status":"planned","text":"Rest at home, then write a short note for Monday's meeting with Shri Hegde.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:a9823f90ed28108e:1","intended_time":"16:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":4,"sha256":"a9823f90ed28108ed34eafaacfb0ca394f48470de786ac04d344ec798ad78a0d"},"status":"planned","text":"Review my vouchers and the dhobi's Saturday bill before the evening.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"action":"talk","end":"06:14","id":"2026-10-04:event:af7cad893ab49293:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"steps","index":0,"sha256":"a